# Vercel builds the web bundle itself now — see "build" in package.json
# (expo export --platform web), wired up via buildCommand in vercel.json.
# So the source tree MUST reach the builder; the old "/*" whitelist stripped
# it and produced empty 404 deployments on every git push.
#
# Only exclude what the build never needs. Note .vercelignore matches at any
# depth, so avoid bare names like "assets" — that would also match dist/assets
# and drop every bundled image and font.
/dist
/design
*.psd
*.fig
